# Experiment Plan — {{ project_name }}

The agent rewrites this file at the **PLAN** phase of every batch (the
Research → Diagnose → Plan → Execute loop). It is the visible record of *why*
each queued experiment exists — diagnosis first, then a mode-valid portfolio.
Free mode targets **≥50% structural** (architecture/ensemble); architecture-
preserving mode forbids both and uses train-only recipe hypotheses. The restart
protocol reads this file; keep it current.

